    "basic_qualifications": "- 2+ years of data engineering experience<br/>- Experience with data modeling, warehousing and building ETL pipelines<br/>- Experience with one or more query language (e.g., SQL, PL/SQL, DDL, MDX, HiveQL, SparkSQL, Scala)<br/>- Experience with one or more scripting language (e.g., Python, KornShell)<br/>- Experience with database, data warehouse or data lake solutions",
